abstract: >-
  A sanitized client-side case study of ChatGPT conversation-loading and
  recovery failures, including HTTP 429 / Too Many Requests observations,
  reproducible timing analysis, retry-amplification dynamics, history-aware
  state modeling, local congestion simulations, provider-friendly recovery
  design, and a bilingual local-only Recovery Helper. The repository does not
  claim to identify OpenAI's internal root cause.
